# Konteks build stack simulasi (docker-compose.yml).
.git
.gitignore
.sim
**/node_modules
server/dist
web/dist
marketing/dist
**/coverage
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
graphify-out
server/uploads
# Artefak build Rust (dikompilasi ulang di dalam image) — kalau tidak
# dikecualikan, konteks build membengkak ~1,4 GB (packages/*/target).
**/target
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
